        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako bakababikila basikubabelesya cibbalo, kuti babapenzye amikuli, nkabela bakayakila Farao minzi yazilondwedo, Pitomu a-Ramese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.11",
